          <span class="jmf-hero-p2-rs">+150 avaliações no Google</span>
        </div>
        <p class="jmf-hero-p2-response"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i> Diagnóstico inicial sem compromisso · resposta em até 24h úteis</p>
      </div>

      <div class="jmf-hero-p2-dash" data-hero-dash>
        <div class="jmf-hd-frame">
          <div class="jmf-hd-glow"></div>
          <div class="jmf-hd-header">
            <span><span class="dot"></span>JMF · Painel do cliente</span>
            <span class="jmf-hd-status"><span class="dt" data-hd-clock>09:42:18</span></span>
